This product includes software developed by Jordan Rainone and contributors to the Portfolio Engine project.

Portfolio Engine is a reusable open-source backbone for personal, portfolio, and editorial websites. It includes runtime packages for schema validation, Astro integration, editorial theming, and optional packages for admin tooling and AI-assisted workflow support.

